WEBVTT

00:07.320 --> 00:08.680
Your son believes

00:08.760 --> 00:10.200
The matter of going north

00:10.280 --> 00:12.280
Is not about money and grain

00:12.840 --> 00:14.240
But an attitude

00:14.840 --> 00:15.840
As the saying goes

00:15.920 --> 00:17.200
A king's enterprise does not rest in peace

00:17.280 --> 00:18.520
Traitors and the state cannot coexist

00:18.600 --> 00:19.320
If the land is lost

00:19.400 --> 00:21.000
It can still be recovered

00:21.080 --> 00:22.520
But if the people's hearts scatter

00:22.600 --> 00:24.000
To gather them again

00:24.520 --> 00:25.760
Will be difficult

00:25.840 --> 00:27.240
How dare you

00:27.400 --> 00:29.400
You're indirectly calling Father a coward

00:29.600 --> 00:31.000
Elder son

00:31.080 --> 00:32.440
Why are you in such a hurry?

00:32.560 --> 00:33.840
I said today

00:33.920 --> 00:35.440
Speak freely

00:38.440 --> 00:39.640
Father

00:39.720 --> 00:41.360
Your son has a few questions

00:41.440 --> 00:42.760
To ask second brother

